{% extends "voc2_en.j2" %}

{% block summary %}
<p>The vocabulary "OSLO Digital Water Meter" defines terms specifically for the management and monitoring of water consumption via digital water meters. It describes characteristic features of digital water meters, including components such as consumption monitoring, sensors, and meters. These terms have been adapted to accurately describe (drinking) water consumption. This vocabulary is aligned with OSLO models IMKL (Information Model Cables and Pipes), tailored to the specific requirements and functionalities of digital water meters.</p>
